# Force LF line endings for shell scripts regardless of local autocrlf
# settings. This repo is authored on Windows (core.autocrlf=true); without
# this, a future edit could silently reintroduce CRLF into a script meant to
# run inside a Linux devcontainer/Codespace, which breaks the shebang line
# ("/usr/bin/env bash\r": No such file or directory) and any embedded \r in
# heredocs/here-strings.
*.sh text eol=lf
